# Signing keys and certificates. The app is not signed today, but this is here
# before any certificate ever reaches the machine rather than after: in a public
# repository a committed key is disclosed the moment it is pushed, and the only
# remedy left is to revoke it.
*.pfx
*.p12
*.snk
*.pem
*.key
*.cer
*.crt
